{
 "elemod": 2,
 "id": "digictl",
 "version": "1.6",
 "title": "Digi FX Control",
 "description": "The DIGI FX and DIGI FILTER pages on the master page tree (FUNC+LFO), as the fourth and fifth entries. DIGI FX: enable and tune EQ (on, low, high), RING (on, depth, frequency), FOLD (on, amount) and the level meter. DIGI FILTER: on/off, mode (BP/BP2/COMB/TRASH), freq, reso and which of the eight voices are filtered (trig keys 1-8 toggle them). Encoders A-H edit one parameter each (OS-style step acceleration). Settings are stored per pattern inside the saved pattern data (they follow pattern switch / reload and a project save, like stock parameters). It drives digieq / digiring / digifold / digimeter / digifilter (all required).",
 "category": "Utilities",
 "author": "Digital Alchemy DSP",
 "license": "GPL-2.0-or-later",
 "target": {
  "device": "digitone-mk1",
  "product": "Digitone mk1",
  "os": "1.43",
  "syx_sha256": "c5a54cc05b921f2e4bd814834c5365c2a5aa01d7772a9a2961fac1c3095bf9aa",
